# Canonical AdBlock source manifest
# Format: SOURCE|POLICY|KIND(optional)
# POLICY: REJECT, REJECT-DROP, REJECT-NO-DROP, DIRECT
# KIND: auto (default), domainset
#
# Rules:
#   - Only .list / .txt / domainset URLs, or .sgmodule files that contain a [Rule] section
#   - Script / URL Rewrite modules: rulesets/Sources/Links/AdBlock_functional_sources.txt → PROMAX
#   - PROMAX references rulesets/AdBlock/*.list via RULE-SET + merged [Script]/[Rewrite] sections
#
# Example:
#   https://example.com/list.txt|REJECT
#   https://example.com/domainset.txt|REJECT|domainset

